// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P212466617" "This is an access point to the Inter-Dimensional Tunnel System, also known as TUNNEL, a network of interconnected portals that connect to all the known dimensions. I've been stationed here on behalf of Arachnos to oversee its operation, ensure its strict code of operations, and monitor it for strange behaviors and fluctuations; the last thing we need is for a portal to go unstable in the middle of a populated area. Beware that while Arachnos believes in exploiting these portals to their fullest potential, the scope of TUNNEL is beyond the authority of Arachnos alone and we cannot guarantee the safety of your transportation and destination. From our explorations with TUNNEL, we can say with some certainty that wherever it takes you, you will be able to find your way back, but there's always the chance that your experience will vary.<br><br><scale 1.5><face heading><font color=PaleGoldenRod>Current Destinations</font></face></span></scale><br><color YellowGreen>Mercy Island<br>Imperial City<br>Underground Imperial<br>Cap Au Diable<br>First Ward<br>Nerva Archipelago<br>Night Ward<br>Grandville<br>Dark Astoria"
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P2820747065" "<em=lecture>TUNNEL is at your disposal.<em=none>"
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// DisplayName for N_TUNNEL_Info :
"P591208562" "TUNNEL Supervisor"

