"P4013990704" "Time grows short traveler, you had best be about your business. The portal between worlds stands open, ready to take you to safety or further into danger, whichever is your inclination.  We have opened this network of portals so that it may conjoin the darkly mirrored realities of Praetoria and Primal Earth. Walk gently on the path and do not stray too far, for we cannot guarantee safety to the foolish traveler.<br><br><scale 1.5><face heading><font color=PaleGoldenRod>Current Destinations</font></face></span></scale><br><color YellowGreen>Atlas Park<br>Imperial City<br>Underground Imperial<br>Talos Island<br>First Ward<br>Night Ward<br>Founders Falls<br>Peregrine Island<br>Fire Base Zulu<br>Dark Astoria"
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P3959897543" "<em=lecture>The way is open, traveler.<em=none>"
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_TUNNEL_Info :
"P1061761471" "Shining Portal Mistress"

