"P2201288233" "This is an access point to the Inter-Dimensional Tunnel System, also known as TUNNEL, a network of interconnected portals that connect to all the known dimensions. I'm here on behalf of Portal Corp to oversee its operation, ensure its strict code of operations and monitor it for strange behaviors and fluctuations; the last thing we need is for a portal to go unstable in the middle of a populated area. Beware that while Portal Corp oversees these portals in Paragon City and elsewhere, the scope of TUNNEL is greater than Portal Corp alone and we cannot guarantee the safety of your transportation and destination. From our explorations with TUNNEL, we can say with some certainty that wherever it takes you, you will be able to find your way back, but there's always the chance that your experience will vary.<br><br><scale 1.5><face heading><font color=PaleGoldenRod>Current Destinations</font></face></span></scale><br><color YellowGreen>Atlas Park<br>Imperial City<br>Underground Imperial<br>Talos Island<br>First Ward<br>Night Ward<br>Founders Falls<br>Peregrine Island<br>Fire Base Zulu<br>Dark Astoria"
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_TUNNEL_Info :
